CORE
unequal.c
--no-bounds-check
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ a\[1\] and b\[1\] may differ: FAILURE$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ a and b may be equal: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Arrays of non-constant size are equal iff all their elements within bounds are
equal.
